(6725094, 1005909, 134859, '<td valign="top">I have come back to this shot time and time again.  I like it, but... there is something that is off to me.  I am thinking it is the face that there are strange edges/outlines on the stem and leaves.  I like the angle of the shot... but this almost looks like it was cut and pasted on a different background... not saying it was, it just looks that way due to the edges.  Lovely blue shades, though.</td>', 'I have come back to this shot time and time again.  I like it, but... there is something that is off to me.  I am thinking it is the face that there are strange edges/outlines on the stem and leaves.  I like the angle of the shot... but this almost looks like it was cut and pasted on a different background... not saying it was, it just looks that way due to the edges.  Lovely blue shades, though.', '2012-03-28 10:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725095, 1006197, 138253, '<td valign="top">Trees are not really the same color as the fog "foreground/background" in my opinion...<br/>it''s a pretty picture, but not really what was being asked for in my opinion.</td>', 'Trees are not really the same color as the fog "foreground/background" in my opinion...it''s a pretty picture, but not really what was being asked for in my opinion.', '2012-03-28 10:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725105, 1006413, 134859, '<td valign="top">Good color on color.  Not quite understanding the witch(?) shadow?  <br/>The idea that you had to cover the light with fabric so that it shines through works well.  <br/>Cool dark effect.</td>', 'Good color on color.  Not quite understanding the witch(?) shadow?  The idea that you had to cover the light with fabric so that it shines through works well.  Cool dark effect.', '2012-03-28 11:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725109, 1006085, 134859, '<td valign="top">The colors are a little too dark for me.  It almost blends in completely.  Perhaps a little more lighting on the pawns (those are pawns, right?), or a darker or lighter background color?  <br/>I like the idea... just the colors are too similar for my liking.</td>', 'The colors are a little too dark for me.  It almost blends in completely.  Perhaps a little more lighting on the pawns (those are pawns, right?), or a darker or lighter background color?  I like the idea... just the colors are too similar for my liking.', '2012-03-28 11:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725110, 1006432, 134859, '<td valign="top">Great camouflage look here.  Nice close up of the lizard.  Good detail as well.</td>', 'Great camouflage look here.  Nice close up of the lizard.  Good detail as well.', '2012-03-28 11:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725113, 1006164, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful yellow tones.  Nice focus.  I think with some extra lighting, this would have turned out even better.  JMO</td>', 'Beautiful yellow tones.  Nice focus.  I think with some extra lighting, this would have turned out even better.  JMO', '2012-03-28 11:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725114, 1006384, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  Great title and in-flight capture!  Nice sharpness and focus as well!</td>', 'Lovely shot.  Great title and in-flight capture!  Nice sharpness and focus as well!', '2012-03-28 11:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725118, 1006437, 134859, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, but it''s a little plain, in my opinion.  Pot calling kettle black here... since this shot has more interest than mine does.  <br/>Anyhow... I think that the lid cracked opened added to the interest, so good choice there.  But maybe if you added some candles, toys, something else white, it would have created a better interest?  Maybe even a white teddy bear hanging out of, or sitting in front of, the chest.  It would have given the idea that there were other trinkets inside, perhaps a child''s toy box.  <br/>Nice detail in the shot.  <br/>Also, the fact that the backdrop looks wrinkled is distracting to me.</td>', 'A nice shot, but it''s a little plain, in my opinion.  Pot calling kettle black here... since this shot has more interest than mine does.  Anyhow... I think that the lid cracked opened added to the interest, so good choice there.  But maybe if you added some candles, toys, something else white, it would have created a better interest?  Maybe even a white teddy bear hanging out of, or sitting in front of, the chest.  It would have given the idea that there were other trinkets inside, perhaps a child''s toy box.  Nice detail in the shot.  Also, the fact that the backdrop looks wrinkled is distracting to me.', '2012-03-28 11:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725150, 1006264, 38162, '<td valign="top">windy title aside, question is more of focus?</td>', 'windy title aside, question is more of focus?', '2012-03-28 11:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725154, 1006438, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, feel there may be a little too much color in this shot to be color on color, though I do get what you''re going for.  Nice focus.  Pretty lighting.</td>', 'Nice shot, feel there may be a little too much color in this shot to be color on color, though I do get what you''re going for.  Nice focus.  Pretty lighting.', '2012-03-28 11:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725155, 1006229, 134859, '<td valign="top">Pretty shades of orange.  The lighting looks a little harsh on the oranges (the fruit, that is).  Love the arrangement, very interesting.  I think the one fruit to the right should have been brought in a little closer, perhaps in front of the short glass, just behind the thing (not sure what it is) in the front right of the picture,<br/>Lovely detail.  Nice focus.  Overall, well done.</td>', 'Pretty shades of orange.  The lighting looks a little harsh on the oranges (the fruit, that is).  Love the arrangement, very interesting.  I think the one fruit to the right should have been brought in a little closer, perhaps in front of the short glass, just behind the thing (not sure what it is) in the front right of the picture,Lovely detail.  Nice focus.  Overall, well done.', '2012-03-28 11:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725156, 1006421, 134859, '<td valign="top">Different and unique.  That''s something I haven''t said so far this challenge.  I like this because I am not sure what it is.  I like the silver tones with specks of black.  I think it''s interesting.  Good composition, not centering the subject.</td>', 'Different and unique.  That''s something I haven''t said so far this challenge.  I like this because I am not sure what it is.  I like the silver tones with specks of black.  I think it''s interesting.  Good composition, not centering the subject.', '2012-03-28 12:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725157, 1006362, 134859, '<td valign="top">Focus loks a little off.  But I do like the DOF here.  And the colors work.  Also, there appears to be light reflections in some of the picture, which is also somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Focus loks a little off.  But I do like the DOF here.  And the colors work.  Also, there appears to be light reflections in some of the picture, which is also somewhat distracting.', '2012-03-28 12:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725158, 1006159, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lovely reds.  I would like to have seen the focus a little sharper, and the light reflection on the vase is distracting to me.  But other than that, I like the setup and shot.</td>', 'Lovely reds.  I would like to have seen the focus a little sharper, and the light reflection on the vase is distracting to me.  But other than that, I like the setup and shot.', '2012-03-28 12:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725159, 1006225, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lovely close up.  Great used of different browns in this capture.  Nice detail and focus.  Well done.</td>', 'Lovely close up.  Great used of different browns in this capture.  Nice detail and focus.  Well done.', '2012-03-28 12:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725168, 1006299, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lovely shades of yellow.</td>', 'Lovely shades of yellow.', '2012-03-28 12:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725169, 1006265, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  Nice tight crop, like the different shades of yellow, the different textures, and the details.  Nice focus as well.  The only thing I may have tried differently is a wider shot, to include the entire set of bananas.  But I like this just as well.</td>', 'Love the title.  Nice tight crop, like the different shades of yellow, the different textures, and the details.  Nice focus as well.  The only thing I may have tried differently is a wider shot, to include the entire set of bananas.  But I like this just as well.', '2012-03-28 12:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725170, 1006435, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, the detail, the uniqueness to this shot.  I wonder who will say DNMC because it looks to be a black and white.  <br/>I, for one, think it''s great.  Lovely image.</td>', 'I like the angle, the detail, the uniqueness to this shot.  I wonder who will say DNMC because it looks to be a black and white.  I, for one, think it''s great.  Lovely image.', '2012-03-28 12:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725171, 1006433, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, like how you did the color on color with two different colors.  Nice detail, and interesting abstract looking shot.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, like how you did the color on color with two different colors.  Nice detail, and interesting abstract looking shot.', '2012-03-28 12:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725242, 1005268, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful gold tones.</td>', 'Beautiful gold tones.', '2012-03-28 13:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725243, 1006178, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the angle of this shot.  Great blue on blue.  Nice detail.</td>', 'Love the angle of this shot.  Great blue on blue.  Nice detail.', '2012-03-28 13:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725244, 1006224, 134859, '<td valign="top">Not too fond of bugs, but this is nice color on color.  Lovely detail as well.</td>', 'Not too fond of bugs, but this is nice color on color.  Lovely detail as well.', '2012-03-28 13:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725245, 1006311, 134859, '<td valign="top">Light from the right is a little overpowering.  But I like the color on color, you could have done this without the ring, which I''m thinking may have been more simplistic, but could have worked well.<br/> <br/>Also, the pen seems to be tilted to the left just a tad.  <br/> <br/>Overall, nice colors, just a few adjustments and it would really pop off the page.</td>', 'Light from the right is a little overpowering.  But I like the color on color, you could have done this without the ring, which I''m thinking may have been more simplistic, but could have worked well. Also, the pen seems to be tilted to the left just a tad.   Overall, nice colors, just a few adjustments and it would really pop off the page.', '2012-03-28 13:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725246, 1006410, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the color on color here.  It would almost be hard to make out without the title.  Love the detail, nice light, good shot.</td>', 'Love the color on color here.  It would almost be hard to make out without the title.  Love the detail, nice light, good shot.', '2012-03-28 13:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725247, 1006408, 134859, '<td valign="top">Interesting close up.  Nice colors.  Would have liked to see a wider shot, however.</td>', 'Interesting close up.  Nice colors.  Would have liked to see a wider shot, however.', '2012-03-28 13:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725249, 1006404, 134859, '<td valign="top">Interesting, different, I like it.  Very nice detail and well shot.</td>', 'Interesting, different, I like it.  Very nice detail and well shot.', '2012-03-28 13:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725250, 1005943, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color.  Really wish this would have been sharper!  Great idea</td>', 'Beautiful color.  Really wish this would have been sharper!  Great idea', '2012-03-28 13:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725251, 1006379, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog!  Love the detail, and the straight on approach.  Perhaps a little sharper?  Maybe a gold tone to warm the shot?  Just some suggestions.</td>', 'Beautiful dog!  Love the detail, and the straight on approach.  Perhaps a little sharper?  Maybe a gold tone to warm the shot?  Just some suggestions.', '2012-03-28 13:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725252, 1006087, 134859, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Nice macro.  A little sharper and it would have been outstanding.  Love the colors</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Nice macro.  A little sharper and it would have been outstanding.  Love the colors', '2012-03-28 13:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725253, 1006149, 134859, '<td valign="top">These things are SO strange!  I have only seen stick bugs a handful of times, and each time, they amaze me.  Great title.  Lovely capture.  Nice detail!  Very well done.</td>', 'These things are SO strange!  I have only seen stick bugs a handful of times, and each time, they amaze me.  Great title.  Lovely capture.  Nice detail!  Very well done.', '2012-03-28 13:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725255, 1006159, 138253, '<td valign="top">I love the bit of green in this sea of red</td>', 'I love the bit of green in this sea of red', '2012-03-28 13:32:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6725257, 1006079, 134859, '<td valign="top">Hibiscus flowers?  Love the color.  Nice detail.  I think if it was a bit sharper it would have really stood out.  Love the water drops!  Very nicely composed.</td>', 'Hibiscus flowers?  Love the color.  Nice detail.  I think if it was a bit sharper it would have really stood out.  Love the water drops!  Very nicely composed.', '2012-03-28 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725258, 1006325, 134859, '<td valign="top">Pretty single flower shot.  Like the detail and sharpness.</td>', 'Pretty single flower shot.  Like the detail and sharpness.', '2012-03-28 13:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725260, 1006188, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  Something about the rust that is appealing.  Guess it''s my love for "older" things.  Great detail.  Nice light.  Very well done.</td>', 'Love this shot.  Something about the rust that is appealing.  Guess it''s my love for "older" things.  Great detail.  Nice light.  Very well done.', '2012-03-28 13:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725261, 1005976, 134859, '<td valign="top">Great title!  :)  Didn''t know shiny was a color... I''m going to have to remember that.  <br/>On a more serious note.  I like what you''ve done with the shot.  The composition is nice, as is the angle.  The detail and focus seem to be good.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great title!  :)  Didn''t know shiny was a color... I''m going to have to remember that.  On a more serious note.  I like what you''ve done with the shot.  The composition is nice, as is the angle.  The detail and focus seem to be good.  Nicely done.', '2012-03-28 13:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725263, 1006152, 138253, '<td valign="top">Did you know that ogres are like onions? :)</td>', 'Did you know that ogres are like onions? :)', '2012-03-28 13:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725264, 1006089, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this.  The direct sunlight looks a little harsh on the tree, especially the one of the left.  The wood on wood gives different textures to the shot, but I''m thinking perhaps a different angle?  Like looking up towards the tree, laying on the ground, taking the shot (but still keeping the fence in)?  I don''t know if it would work.. but it''s worth a shot to try.  <br/>Anyhow... I do like the detail, the lighting is just throwing it off for me.</td>', 'I like the concept of this.  The direct sunlight looks a little harsh on the tree, especially the one of the left.  The wood on wood gives different textures to the shot, but I''m thinking perhaps a different angle?  Like looking up towards the tree, laying on the ground, taking the shot (but still keeping the fence in)?  I don''t know if it would work.. but it''s worth a shot to try.  Anyhow... I do like the detail, the lighting is just throwing it off for me.', '2012-03-28 13:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725266, 1005741, 134859, '<td valign="top">LOVE this... reminds me of the show "Swamp People", one of my favorites.  yeah, I''m country... so what?  lol<br/>Great capture.  Perhaps a little wider to include the snout/mouth of the alligator and it would have been even better.  Love the colors though.  And great detail.</td>', 'LOVE this... reminds me of the show "Swamp People", one of my favorites.  yeah, I''m country... so what?  lolGreat capture.  Perhaps a little wider to include the snout/mouth of the alligator and it would have been even better.  Love the colors though.  And great detail.', '2012-03-28 13:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725267, 1005739, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lovely shades of yellow.  Nice detail.  The sunlight is overpowering the shot for me, but that''s just my opinion.  I do like the detail, the way it was shot to the left of the center, the dewdrops... very nice shot.</td>', 'Lovely shades of yellow.  Nice detail.  The sunlight is overpowering the shot for me, but that''s just my opinion.  I do like the detail, the way it was shot to the left of the center, the dewdrops... very nice shot.', '2012-03-28 13:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725269, 1006364, 134859, '<td valign="top">I really want to like this shot, as I LOVE old cars.  I think that there is just too much going on.  Perhaps cropping in a bit tighter to focus on one particular area may have helped?  Or even a wider shot, maybe in a field?  <br/>The focus also seems to be a tad off.  <br/>But I do like the concept of this.  :)</td>', 'I really want to like this shot, as I LOVE old cars.  I think that there is just too much going on.  Perhaps cropping in a bit tighter to focus on one particular area may have helped?  Or even a wider shot, maybe in a field?  The focus also seems to be a tad off.  But I do like the concept of this.  :)', '2012-03-28 13:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725271, 1006380, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Not too fond of the noise/grain in this shot.  A lot of times, I think it works to the advantage of a photo, but with a flower, I think it takes away from the beauty.  I do like the close up, and concept... just the noise that''s throwing it off for me.  Maybe a soft focus would have worked, making the flower appear more delicate?  Just a thought.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Not too fond of the noise/grain in this shot.  A lot of times, I think it works to the advantage of a photo, but with a flower, I think it takes away from the beauty.  I do like the close up, and concept... just the noise that''s throwing it off for me.  Maybe a soft focus would have worked, making the flower appear more delicate?  Just a thought.', '2012-03-28 13:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725272, 1006197, 134859, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of the trees... this would have been good for the double take challenge coming up.  There are a few things I am not too keen on, the horizon being tilted, the fact that the entire reflection wasn''t included in the shot, and the small tree to the left takes away from the shot (as does the little thing beside the left tree). <br/>I do like the attempt, and the idea... just a few adjustments in my opinion</td>', 'I really like the idea of the trees... this would have been good for the double take challenge coming up.  There are a few things I am not too keen on, the horizon being tilted, the fact that the entire reflection wasn''t included in the shot, and the small tree to the left takes away from the shot (as does the little thing beside the left tree). I do like the attempt, and the idea... just a few adjustments in my opinion', '2012-03-28 13:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725273, 1005364, 134859, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  I can see the color on color... but the shot doesn''t have much appeal, to me.  It''s a lonely shot to me... nothing grabs at my interest.  Just my two cents.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  I can see the color on color... but the shot doesn''t have much appeal, to me.  It''s a lonely shot to me... nothing grabs at my interest.  Just my two cents.', '2012-03-28 13:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725274, 1005955, 134859, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but I think that the focus is a little off, the shadows are taking away, and the spots under the handle are distracting.  Perhaps different lighting and a bit sharper, and it really would have stood out.</td>', 'A good idea, but I think that the focus is a little off, the shadows are taking away, and the spots under the handle are distracting.  Perhaps different lighting and a bit sharper, and it really would have stood out.', '2012-03-28 13:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725275, 1006077, 134859, '<td valign="top">Good idea, lighting is a little harsh.</td>', 'Good idea, lighting is a little harsh.', '2012-03-28 13:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725276, 1006317, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice set up.  But I''m at odds with this.  The lighting isn''t adding to the shot, rather it is taking away from it.  Perhaps another light to the right... a softer look.  The crop off of the leg and elbow also bother me.  Maybe a different angle would have made it a bit more interesting as well.</td>', 'Nice set up.  But I''m at odds with this.  The lighting isn''t adding to the shot, rather it is taking away from it.  Perhaps another light to the right... a softer look.  The crop off of the leg and elbow also bother me.  Maybe a different angle would have made it a bit more interesting as well.', '2012-03-28 13:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725277, 1006376, 134859, '<td valign="top">A nice, crisp, close up of the clover, LOVE the detail of the dewdrops... but perhaps if the background was a bit more OOF it would have really stood out.  And the torn and bent leaves are distracting.  I do like the idea.  And it''s a decent shot overall.</td>', 'A nice, crisp, close up of the clover, LOVE the detail of the dewdrops... but perhaps if the background was a bit more OOF it would have really stood out.  And the torn and bent leaves are distracting.  I do like the idea.  And it''s a decent shot overall.', '2012-03-28 13:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725278, 1006382, 134859, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  My boys LOVE squirrels.  They chase them up trees all the time, lol.  <br/> <br/>Good detail, love the composition.  Nice focus as well.  Well done.</td>', 'Cool shot.  My boys LOVE squirrels.  They chase them up trees all the time, lol.   Good detail, love the composition.  Nice focus as well.  Well done.', '2012-03-28 13:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725280, 1006253, 134859, '<td valign="top">I do like the color on color, but I think the focus is a bit off, too much blur for my liking.</td>', 'I do like the color on color, but I think the focus is a bit off, too much blur for my liking.', '2012-03-28 13:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725282, 1006385, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is different.  Not sure if I like it or not.  I''ll have to get back to you on that one.  <br/>I do like the concept.</td>', 'This is different.  Not sure if I like it or not.  I''ll have to get back to you on that one.  I do like the concept.', '2012-03-28 13:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725283, 1006103, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, the detail is good.  If it was on a brighter background (lighter yellow shade), I think it would have looked even better for the challenge.  But this is also nice.</td>', 'Nice colors, the detail is good.  If it was on a brighter background (lighter yellow shade), I think it would have looked even better for the challenge.  But this is also nice.', '2012-03-28 13:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725284, 1006357, 134859, '<td valign="top">Different.  A little plain to me.  But I like the idea.  Its out of the box.  :)</td>', 'Different.  A little plain to me.  But I like the idea.  Its out of the box.  :)', '2012-03-28 13:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725285, 1006017, 134859, '<td valign="top">Loving the title.  Great focus.  Nice shot overall.  A little too much color going on for what I would "think" is color on color (for this particular challenge).  But it''s a good set up and some nice detail to the shot.</td>', 'Loving the title.  Great focus.  Nice shot overall.  A little too much color going on for what I would "think" is color on color (for this particular challenge).  But it''s a good set up and some nice detail to the shot.', '2012-03-28 13:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725288, 1006365, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lots of color going on.  I think that if you would have focused on the flower all the way to the bottom right, made a tight crop, and had that as the image, it would have worked better for this particular challenge.  Just my thoughts.</td>', 'Lots of color going on.  I think that if you would have focused on the flower all the way to the bottom right, made a tight crop, and had that as the image, it would have worked better for this particular challenge.  Just my thoughts.', '2012-03-28 13:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725290, 1006172, 134859, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like the white balance is off to achieve this shot.  The focus also seems to be on the top flower, the little green part coming down... I think it should have been more on the first flower, or even the bottom two flowers.  JMO</td>', 'It almost looks like the white balance is off to achieve this shot.  The focus also seems to be on the top flower, the little green part coming down... I think it should have been more on the first flower, or even the bottom two flowers.  JMO', '2012-03-28 13:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725295, 1006444, 134859, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea.  I think that this may have worked better if you had been looking down, or at a different angle (this straight on approach takes away from it).  Maybe cropping out the top of the stove, where the knobs and clock were, would have helped.  Also, as you mentioned, there is dust/particles on the stovetop and coffeemug, perhaps cleaning/wiping them down, then reshooting would have worked better.</td>', 'An interesting idea.  I think that this may have worked better if you had been looking down, or at a different angle (this straight on approach takes away from it).  Maybe cropping out the top of the stove, where the knobs and clock were, would have helped.  Also, as you mentioned, there is dust/particles on the stovetop and coffeemug, perhaps cleaning/wiping them down, then reshooting would have worked better.', '2012-03-28 14:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725296, 1006406, 134859, '<td valign="top">Looks like a conversion to black and white, which I am sure people will say DNMC.  There looks to be haloing around the objects?</td>', 'Looks like a conversion to black and white, which I am sure people will say DNMC.  There looks to be haloing around the objects?', '2012-03-28 14:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725298, 1006264, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the title, makes me think.  Like the detail.  A little OOF for me, however.</td>', 'Love the title, makes me think.  Like the detail.  A little OOF for me, however.', '2012-03-28 14:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
