(6730202, 1006017, 12611, '<td valign="top">DNMC police strike again. The oak leaf is a nice touch.<br/> <br/>All I can think of when I read your description, is Lethal Weapon- "When I was 19, I did a guy in Laos from a thousand yards out. It was a rifle shot in high wind. Maybe eight or even ten guys in the world could have made that shot. It''s the only thing I was ever good at."<br/> <br/>If your neighbors are paranoid, we''ll all know why!</td>', 'DNMC police strike again. The oak leaf is a nice touch. All I can think of when I read your description, is Lethal Weapon- "When I was 19, I did a guy in Laos from a thousand yards out. It was a rifle shot in high wind. Maybe eight or even ten guys in the world could have made that shot. It''s the only thing I was ever good at." If your neighbors are paranoid, we''ll all know why!', '2012-04-02 17:46:14.000000', NULL, 0),
